        "avatar_url": "https://images.zsxq.com/FvqruR008tptfgIqRoCvSY8Lhvi9?imageMogr2/auto-orient/thumbnail/150x/format/jpg/blur/1x0/quality/75/ignore-error/1&e=1780243199&token=q6iZ0sQtf9U7s1qz0r4yMawNq3-u2w6lbnai6y2J:bye6HajGcmXPCttoG8KPQN4GFqM=",
        "location": "北京"
      },
      "text": "370《刚性泡沫 \n1 ：中国经济的增长和风险<e type=\"web\" href=\"https%3A%2F%2Ft.zsxq.com%2FoNWLE\" title=\"%E5%88%9A%E6%80%A7%E6%B3%A1%E6%B2%AB1%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E7%BB%8F%E6%B5%8E%E7%9A%84%E5%A2%9E%E9%95%BF%E5%92%8C%E9%A3%8E...\" />\n2：隐形担保因何泛滥<e type=\"web\" href=\"https%3A%2F%2Ft.zsxq.com%2FKKEdi\" title=\"%E5%88%9A%E6%80%A7%E6%B3%A1%E6%B2%AB2%EF%BC%9A%E9%9A%90%E5%BD%A2%E6%8B%85%E4%BF%9D%E5%9B%A0%E4%BD%95%E6%B3%9B%E6%BB%A5\" />\n3：影子银行和P2P<e type=\"web\" href=\"https%3A%2F%2Ft.zsxq.com%2F8QbRC\" title=\"%E5%88%9A%E6%80%A7%E6%B3%A1%E6%B2%AB3%EF%BC%9A%E5%BD%B1%E5%AD%90%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E5%92%8CP2P\" />\n4：P2P因何爆雷?<e type=\"web\" href=\"https%3A%2F%2Ft.zsxq.com%2F0Lg7q\" title=\"%E5%88%9A%E6%80%A7%E6%B3%A1%E6%B2%AB4%EF%BC%9AP2P%E5%9B%A0%E4%BD%95%E7%88%86%E9%9B%B7%3F\" />\n5：房地产其实也是一场刚性兑付<e type=\"web\" href=\"https%3A%2F%2Ft.zsxq.com%2Fg8JbW\" title=\"%E5%88%9A%E6%80%A7%E6%B3%A1%E6%B2%AB5%EF%BC%9A%E6%88%BF%E5%9C%B0%E4%BA%A7%E5%85%B6%E5%AE%9E%E4%B9%9F%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E5%9C%BA...\" />\n6：房地产的风险是如何产生的<e type=\"web\" href=\"https%3A%2F%2Ft.zsxq.com%2FJsxSe\" title=\"%E5%88%9A%E6%80%A7%E6%B3%A1%E6%B2%AB6%EF%BC%9A%E6%88%BF%E5%9C%B0%E4%BA%A7%E7%9A%84%E9%A3%8E%E9%99%A9%E6%98%AF%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95...\" />\n7：房价永远上涨的预期是如何转变的<e type=\"web\" href=\"https%3A%2F%2Ft.zsxq.com%2FiBz13\" title=\"%E5%88%9A%E6%80%A7%E6%B3%A1%E6%B2%AB7%EF%BC%9A%E6%88%BF%E4%BB%B7%E6%B0%B8%E8%BF%9C%E4%B8%8A%E6%B6%A8%E7%9A%84%E9%A2%84%E6%9C%9F...\" />\n8：P2P乱象是怎么发展起来的<e type=\"web\" href=\"https%3A%2F%2Ft.zsxq.com%2FUNALm\" title=\"%E5%88%9A%E6%80%A7%E6%B3%A1%E6%B2%AB8%EF%BC%9AP2P%E4%B9%B1%E8%B1%A1%E6%98%AF%E6%80%8E%E4%B9%88%E5%8F%91...\" />\n9：温州商人的互保体系<e type=\"web\" href=\"https%3A%2F%2Ft.zsxq.com%2FdSFPP\" title=\"%E5%88%9A%E6%80%A7%E6%B3%A1%E6%B2%AB9%EF%BC%9A%E6%B8%A9%E5%B7%9E%E5%95%86%E4%BA%BA%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%92%E4%BF%9D%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB\" />\n10：有效需求不足是不是分配出了问题？<e type=\"web\" href=\"https%3A%2F%2Ft.zsxq.com%2FZ5dS2\" title=\"%E5%88%9A%E6%80%A7%E6%B3%A1%E6%B2%AB10%EF%BC%9A%E6%9C%89%E6%95%88%E9%9C%80%E6%B1%82%E4%B8%8D%E8%B6%B3%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%8D...\" />\n11：近几年的政策转变<e type=\"web\" href=\"https%3A%2F%2Ft.zsxq.com%2FzomxB\" title=\"%E5%88%9A%E6%80%A7%E6%B3%A1%E6%B2%AB11%EF%BC%9A%E8%BF%91%E5%87%A0%E5%B9%B4%E7%9A%84%E6%94%BF%E7%AD%96%E8%BD%AC%E5%8F%98\" />\n12：为什么会出清艰难<e type=\"web\" href=\"https%3A%2F%2Ft.zsxq.com%2FD1iAE\" title=\"%E5%88%9A%E6%80%A7%E6%B3%A1%E6%B2%AB12%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E4%BC%9A%E5%87%BA%E6%B8%85%E8%89%B0%E9%9A%BE\" />\n13：化债才是这几年最大的基本面<e type=\"web\" href=\"https%3A%2F%2Ft.zsxq.com%2FZ7eGo\" title=\"%E5%88%9A%E6%80%A7%E6%B3%A1%E6%B2%AB13%EF%BC%9A%E5%8C%96%E5%80%BA%E6%89%8D%E6%98%AF%E8%BF%99%E5%87%A0%E5%B9%B4%E6%9C%80...\" />\n14：社保体系资金不足怎么办？<e type=\"web\" href=\"https%3A%2F%2Ft.zsxq.com%2FKclBY\" title=\"%E5%88%9A%E6%80%A7%E6%B3%A1%E6%B2%AB14%EF%BC%9A%E7%A4%BE%E4%BF%9D%E4%BD%93%E7%B3%BB%E8%B5%84%E9%87%91%E4%B8%8D%E8%B6%B3...\" />\n15：收入分配该如何调整<e type=\"web\" href=\"https%3A%2F%2Ft.zsxq.com%2FtkVZC\" title=\"%E5%88%9A%E6%80%A7%E6%B3%A1%E6%B2%AB15%EF%BC%9A%E6%94%B6%E5%85%A5%E5%88%86%E9%85%8D%E8%AF%A5%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E8%B0%83...\" />\n16：如何看待卖空<e type=\"web\" href=\"https%3A%2F%2Ft.zsxq.com%2FHKC9v\" title=\"%E5%88%9A%E6%80%A7%E6%B3%A1%E6%B2%AB16%EF%BC%9A%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E7%9C%8B%E5%BE%85%E5%8D%96%E7%A9%BA\" />",
